{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Don't pay for the water.|It's free."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong way."},{"id":"s3","text":"Pay for water?|Never."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same glass.|New move."},{"id":"s5","text":"Pour it yourself.|Help yourself."},{"id":"s6","text":"She called out—"},{"id":"s7","text":"Free water.|Free tea."},{"id":"s8","text":"Drink up.|No bill."},{"id":"s9","text":"Water's free.|Refills too."},{"id":"n1","text":"The water is free.|So is the tea."},{"id":"n2","text":"Pour it yourself.|At the table."},{"id":"n3","text":"No waiter?|No bill.|Just help yourself."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}